# Local debugging and testing

- From the project root, use `dotnet run --project src/ArtPet.Windows/ArtPet.Windows.csproj -c Debug` to build and launch current source for desktop testing.
- Run task-specific checks against the source build. Run `dotnet publish` and build a package only when the user asks for a package or for validation of the published build.
- Verify size and animation frame rate programmatically during acceptance testing. Use physical mouse clicks to test these two settings only when the user explicitly requests them.
